===Etymology===
{{-er|freeze}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[container]] or [[room]] used to [[store]] food or other [[perishable]] [[item]]s at [[temperature]]s below 273 [[Kelvin]] (0 [[Celsius]]).

====Synonyms====
